==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 23.67 seconds<sup>710f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Due to the buff on the Gory Darks and the restriction in place, powerful anti-Dark units are to be brought, such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]].

If the player does not have these units, powerful area attackers such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] should be brought instead and re-summoned when they die.

